From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:56:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msm8996-common: host lgeims_mmpf in com.lge.ims; libimswms
 NULL-format log shim

lgeims_mmpf (LG media engine, needed by libims AudioAdaptor for voice) is
published on stock by the persistent com.lge.imsvt process. Host it in-process
instead: MmpfHost.start() (extra-smali, hooked into JNIIms.<clinit> after
loadLibrary) -> Java_com_lge_ims_compat_MmpfHost_instantiate in libimscompat ->
android::MMPFService::instantiate() located in the apk-bundled libimsmmpf via
dl_iterate_phdr + GNU hash (dlopen resolves in the caller's namespace, so a
public system lib cannot dlopen an app-bundled lib).

With mmpf up the SMS-over-IP app initialises and hits libimswms error paths,
which all call __android_log_print(6, tag, NULL, "fmt", ...) -> vsnprintf(NULL)
SIGSEGV. build-ims4.sh now renames libimswms's import to __lgims_log_nullfmt
(forge rename-import.py, same-length .dynstr rewrite) and libimscompat provides
it (NULL fmt -> first vararg). build-ims4.sh: fix BUILD_ROOT default, absolutize
inputs (relative smali-fw became a dangling symlink).
---
 ims/build-ims4.sh                             | 11 ++-
 .../com/lge/ims/compat/MmpfHost.smali         | 36 ++++++++
 ims/libimscompat/Android.bp                   |  2 +
 ims/libimscompat/imscompat.cpp                | 92 +++++++++++++++++++
 ims/smali-fixups.py                           | 18 +++-
 5 files changed, 156 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ims/extra-smali/com/lge/ims/compat/MmpfHost.smali

